  `,paraId:7},{value:`
  `,paraId:7},{value:`
    `,paraId:7},{value:`
  `,paraId:7},{value:"Green-centered analogous (roughly half wheel) avoids red and purple, covers all 3 theme hues, and distributes hues evenly (~45\xB0 apart).",paraId:17,tocIndex:12},{value:`
  `,paraId:7},{value:`
