  `,paraId:7},{value:`
    `,paraId:7},{value:`
  `,paraId:7},{value:"Complementary gives high contrast. Split-complementary can pick 5 hues with ~30\xB0 split, covering the 3 theme hues.",paraId:18,tocIndex:13},{value:`
