    `,paraId:2},{value:`
  `,paraId:2},{value:"When system execution takes too long and users need to wait for completion before continuing, provide global notification after task completion to inform users of the result and invite them to complete follow-up tasks.",paraId:3,tocIndex:2},{value:`
  `,paraId:2},{value:`
  `,paraId:2},{value:"Uncertainty causes anxiety. Therefore, provide users with clear information during operations. For tasks with many steps, clearly inform users of their current position and next steps. For operations that take a long time, in addition to system execution status, provide estimated duration to help users set reasonable expectations and ease waiting anxiety.",paraId:4,tocIndex:3},{value:"Clearly show users' current position and required steps through step navigation.",paraId:5,tocIndex:4},{value:`
